            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.13</link>
            <sparkle:version>46</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.13</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.13

- Adds real model-download progress to Kiki Checkup and the compact transcription window.
- Clearly distinguishes downloading a model from loading it for transcription.
- Keeps Parakeet multi-file progress continuous and reports Whisper downloads from transferred bytes.
- Makes Home and Checkup readiness reflect live microphone, accessibility, model, shortcut, and first-dictation state.
- Improves keyboard focus, readable secondary text, destructive-action confirmation, and action-row consistency across Kiki.
- Preserves the approved dark Studio Hardware layout while tightening responsive and accessibility behavior.
]]></description>
